Package: eCH0265
Title: R packages of the eCH-0265 documentation
Version: 2.0.0
Description: Lists the R packages that the code chunks of docs/*/index.qmd
    need. They are installed by `make setup` locally and by the action
    r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies in CI, both with pak, which also
    installs the system libraries the packages require.
Imports:
    knitr (>= 1.45),
    rmarkdown (>= 2.25),
    rdflib,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    stringr,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    ggforce,
    igraph,
    tidygraph,
    ggraph,
    graphlayouts
Encoding: UTF-8
